00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.660
<i>stopping at the flower shop to buy a planter.</i>

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.160
<i>Recently, this has become my daily routine.</i>

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.250
That yellow one...

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.340
Um... This one?

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.340
