00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.590
Yeah. I don't need a bag or anything. I live nearby.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:34.720
All right then.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.100
Thanks, as always.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:43.270
<i>Even Tora would've conveyed his feelings to the Madonna a little easier.</i>

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.520
There you are. Twenty yen is your change.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.270
