00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>Always... always...</i>

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.280
<i>I don't even know her name,</i>

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.060
<i>but I'm sure that,</i>

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:00.540
<i>just like this greenery is overrunning my apartment, my repressed feelings for her are growing.</i>

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.540
<i>Growing...</i>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.920
<i>Receiving my change from her is the only pitiful, cheap satisfaction that I get.</i>

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.460
<i>While ruminating over it, I wait for night.</i>

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.430
What was that bandage for?

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.930
But man, it's such a cute look...

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:24.940
Wonder if we would've talked more if I had asked her about it...

