00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.060
Huh?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.310
<i>I get it.</i>

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.810
<i>I'm in no position to say this,</i>

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.480
