00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.220
What are you to Rokka?

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.010
That's what I wanna ask you.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.640
She's my wife.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:06.980
No romance in her life, yeah, right. She's got a spouse!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:10.320
Well, I mean, when I was still alive...

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.200
If you go by "till death do us part,"

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.410
our wedding vows are null and void.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.790
Um... wait a second.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.910
I'm missing something here...

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:25.710
I'm Shimao Atsushi.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.500
Shimao Atsushi...

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.210
Yes.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.800
No, not your name.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.670
Um, I mean, Shimao, what are you?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.550
Me? I'm... I don't know.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.390
This is the first time someone's acknowledged my existence.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.850
That. Would you stop with that?

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.600
What?

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.650
Talking like you're no longer around.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.610
But it's true.

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:48.860
You're right here!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.110
I'm surprised, too, since you can see me...

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:56.320
Fine. Fine, whatever...

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.370
So if that's true, then the manager is a widow?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.410
She's... Yeah.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.250
You could say that.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.750
This is the first I've heard.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:09.590
Are you surprised?

00:10:09.590 --> 00:10:11.500
Yes, well...

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.300
Can I ask you something?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.130
What is it?

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.720
What was he like?

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.890
He was forgetful.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:28.900
And so scatterbrained that when we first opened the shop,

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:31.110
he made a ton of mistakes with orders.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.400
He also had an illness,

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.530
so we kind of rushed into marriage.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.660
Illness?

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:38.320
Uh-huh.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:43.410
He always used to say, "Even if a fool dies, he won't be cured."

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.160
I died carelessly... I think.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.960
Hard to believe, even if you say it with a straight face.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:49.920
Yeah, well...

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:54.090
What I wanna know is why you were standing around in your underwear yesterday.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:57.760
I thought if you could see me by chance, maybe you'd leave.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:59.220
I <i>did</i> leave.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.680
Then my plan worked.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.060
What do you want?

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.100
I want to make Rokka happy.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.520
If you really are dead, then that's impossible.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.980
That's pretty harsh.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.270
You're in love with Rokka, aren't you?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.490
That's none of your business.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.280
Come to think of it,

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.240
you're not scared of me at all.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.200
I might take over your body and kill you.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.700
Why would you do that?

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.460
Because I want your body.

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:29.920
My body?

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:30.670
That's right.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.080
Uh-huh.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.460
Not gonna happen.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.760
Even though you can see me, I guess I still can't touch you.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.020
What the fuck...

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.850
Is this for real?!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:50.390
That was close.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:53.190
You should pay more attention to your surroundings.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.820
Recently, I haven't been feeling right.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.570
Just to give you fair warning...

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.160
Y-You really are...

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.870
That's what I've been telling you.

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:03.910
But...

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.990
Shocking, isn't it?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.290
Are you still smoking?

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.790
Um...

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:12.630
What?

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.630
Make sure you dispose of your cigarette butt properly.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.090
I will.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.460
Well, let's eat!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.510
Yay!

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.550
Hazuki!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.130
Coming!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:36.860
<i>It's like those 3-D pictures that used to be popular.</i>

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:40.490
<i>Like when at the moment you combine the two different images,</i>

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.360
<i>your memory of being unable to see it is faded.</i>

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.870
<i>You go from being unable to see it to always seeing it.</i>

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.200
<i>Even if you don't want to...</i>

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:50.870
Say, Hazuki...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:55.460
I've got two deliveries to make, then I'll grab lunch.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.250
I'll be back in about two hours.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.000
All right.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.670
Call me if you need anything and take care of the shop while I'm gone.

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:01.380
See you later.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.130
Bye.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:14.650
What?

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:16.980
Huh. You <i>can</i> see me.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.400
Not like I have a choice.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.070
Why did you come to the shop?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.650
Whether you like it or not, this is my house.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.950
Please stay on the second floor.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.160
It's strange...

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.240
What is?

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.950
I've been floating around all this time, nobody bothering me,

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.130
and just when somebody finally notices me, I just end up annoying him.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:37.750
That's because you really <i>are</i> annoying.

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:41.800
I'm surprised you don't get tired of gazing at your wife day after day.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.260
I bet she'd think it was creepy if she knew.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.640
I don't think you have room to talk.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:47.970
Huh?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.180
Staring at her with that nasty look in your eyes,

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.560
even though you don't have the courage to steal her from me.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.060
Leave me alone. This is how I was born.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.690
Were you born a coward, too?

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.900
I'm not gonna take the bait. Not from some mysterious life form.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:04.950
Is that right?

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:07.070
Hello!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:10.030
Sorry! The train was late.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:13.790
Oh, boy! They said there was some trouble with the crossing...

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:14.580
Huh?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.830
You are...

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.590
If you're looking for the manager, she's out on a delivery...

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.920
You're a part-timer?

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:23.590
Right...

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.590
I'll just be coming in on the weekend to help out. My name's Shimao Miho.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.140
Shimao?

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.800
The manager's sister-in-law.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.100
Then...

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.310
My big sister.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.350
Uh, oh, really?

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.020
Yes.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:39.730
Shoo!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.570
Nothing. Look forward to working with you.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:43.280
Likewise...

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:47.110
Ow...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.280
You can put my bag anywhere.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.450
Okay.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.870
I'll leave it here.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.290
Thank you.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:59.960
Um... Shimao...

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:03.750
Since the manager and I have the same last name, let's go with "Miho."

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.300
Okay, Miho...

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:05.800
Yes?

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:09.260
You said you'd help out on the weekends, but today is Thursday...

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:13.310
Oh, that's all right. After all, it's someone's birthday tomorrow, right?

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.810
Yours?

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:15.810
Rokka's...

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.650
Nothing. So what were you saying?

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:24.190
I came early so she can at least take tomorrow off.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:29.450
I'd like her to take as much time off as she wants for her birthday.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:34.950
<i>It pisses me off when a bigmouth suddenly clams up because it means something is up.</i>

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:40.580
I probably shouldn't say this since we just met, but I hate cut flowers.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.080
<i>Then why...</i>

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:46.510
I had enough of putting out flowers, then throwing them away a long time ago.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:53.970
<i>I can't ask her if those flowers were from hospital visits to her brother...</i>

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.040
I didn't check the weather...

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.460
They said this morning it was going to really come down.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.760
Anyway, it really helps that you came over, Miho.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.470
Get a lot of orders.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.640
Yep, I will.

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:34.340
You don't need to change clothes?

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.350
<i>Her birthday...
You don't need to change clothes?</i>

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:36.640
I'm fine.
<i>Her birthday...</i>

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.520
<i>Flowers for a florist is a shitty present idea...</i>

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:45.690
Hazuki, it started raining, so you want to have lunch together?

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.610
You said you were gonna have lunch while you were out...

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:51.400
It suddenly started pouring, so I came back after making the deliveries.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.240
Oh.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.360
Go ahead. I'll mind the shop.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.120
We'll be back in half an hour.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:56.830
<i>Did her saying my name as her husband hovered over us really make me feel superior?
We'll be back in half an hour.</i>

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:57.410
<i>Did her saying my name as her husband hovered over us really make me feel superior?</i>

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.620
What's good around here?
<i>Did her saying my name as her husband hovered over us really make me feel superior?</i>

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.120
I guess Chinese?
<i>Did her saying my name as her husband hovered over us really make me feel superior?</i>

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:00.870
I guess Chinese?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:01.710
<i>That's pretty low.
I guess Chinese?</i>

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:02.250
<i>That's pretty low.</i>

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.210
Or ramen?

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:05.880
Hey, Hazuki,

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.000
do you have an umbrella?

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.760
Manager,

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.420
tomorrow's your birthday, huh?

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.050
Huh?

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:14.890
Yeah...

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.350
Did Miho say something about it?

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.100
Yes...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.810
well...

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:25.400
There's nothing to celebrate at my age,

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.860
but I end up doing it every year anyway.

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:30.610
It's our only anniversary.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.110
Anniversary?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.150
Yeah. Our wedding anniversary.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.950
I'm not good at remembering important days like that,

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.660
so we registered our marriage on my birthday.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.580
It was his idea.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:51.050
But this is a secret from him.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.880
I keep breaking my promises to him.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.300
Promises?

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.840
He was a strange guy.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:00.640
It's like he had no sense of attachment...

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:04.940
He'd tell me to get a divorce when he died...

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:07.600
And to throw away all of his belongings...

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.310
He was adamant about it.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:12.650
"Move on to the next guy! Move on to the next one!"

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.400
Not even understanding how I felt...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.030
<i>Talking to her like that's playing dirty.</i>

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.910
<i>No sense of attachment?</i>

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:21.910
<i>What a liar he is!</i>

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.910
Who would just be able to move on like that?

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.170
Let's move on.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.670
<i>You're the one who's clinging on, even after death.</i>

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.930
<i>Talking like you're so selfless, all the while snatching away her feelings...</i>

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.350
Your husband's wishes are important, aren't they?

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.400
So...

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.110
I mean...

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.900
<i>This is so underhanded...</i>

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.650
For example... you could...

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:56.950
have an affair with me or something...

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:00.820
<i>What the hell am I saying?!</i>

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.660
You're just...

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.370
Manager, don't brush this off.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.460
This is very important.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:13.630
<i>I've been in love with you all this time.</i>

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:17.010
<i>Your hands, unexpectedly covered in blisters...</i>

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.010
<i>The roundness of your forehead...</i>

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.510
<i>All this time...</i>

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.520
The surprise made me even hungrier.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:37.490
Let's eat!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.530
<i>The deceased should act like the deceased,</i>

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:45.950
<i>and not just keep her to himself.</i>

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.620
<i>Instead, he should let me have my chance.</i>

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:56.800
Your noodles will get limp.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.230
Why...

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.480
Why what?

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:15.610
I mean, you're...

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.610
I tear up whenever I eat something hot.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.360
It's not your nose?

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:25.030
Hazuki...

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.080
Yes?

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.040
You're in love with me?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.330
Yes, I am!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:34.080
Really?

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.840
If I wasn't, what would all this be about?

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.270
Welcome back.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.110
There's a rainbow!

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:56.110
Really?

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.480
Uh-huh! Look!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.110
Oh!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.360
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:00.570
I haven't seen one in a long time.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.820
You shared an umbrella.
I haven't seen one in a long time.

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:02.240
You shared an umbrella.

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.120
<i>Just what part of this guy has no sense of attachment?</i>

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:07.700
You don't need an umbrella, do you? You're young.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.740
You know what, Shimao?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.250
One of these days, I'm gonna steal your wife.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:15.750
Oh?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.250
Don't give me an "oh"!

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:26.220
Inside the dreams I always have

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:31.980
you always smile

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:36.060
Tell me why

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:39.940
it won't go away

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.740
I gave you everything

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.570
You gave me everything

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:48.370
Forever and ever
You're everything,

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.040
still my everything

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.250
I love you

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:56.630
The songs of midsummer days

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:59.750
are a fleeting miracle

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:05.720
like the winter snow

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:12.720
If I hadn't met you

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:15.940
I wouldn't have felt this sadness

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:23.440
and nothing would have pressed down on my dreams

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:29.120
If I hadn't been able to meet you

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:36.160
I would never have known the tenderness in strength

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:41.290
When I close my eyes

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:45.300
you're right beside me
